# Fast checks only: scan for credentials, then lint and format the staged files.
#
# Anything slower belongs in pre-push or CI. A pre-commit hook that runs the
# whole suite is a hook people start bypassing, and a bypassed hook protects
# nothing.
#
# The secret scan is first: a credential that reaches a commit needs rotating,
# not fixing, so this is the last point where it is still cheap.
node scripts/check-secrets.mjs
npx lint-staged
